      "statement": "BackupDatabase writes per-collection BSON ZIP entries inside the coordinator's RunWithUpdatesPausedAsync, buffers each serialized document in memory, returns failure with an alert when the pause cannot be confirmed, deletes the partial archive on failure or cancellation, and prunes old archives only after success.",
